      "rendered": "</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-ast-global-color-3-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9918c6dc444b7d998edc13c9c7193f99\" style=\"min-height: 505px; aspect-ratio: unset;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-14 size-full\" style=\"object-position: 55% 25%;\" src=\"https://alshaabalwaseem.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/HDPE-scrap-supplier-Sharjah-Sajja-Industrial-Area-location-map-1.jpg\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" srcset=\"https://alshaabalwaseem.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/HDPE-scrap-supplier-Sharjah-Sajja-Industrial-Area-location-map-1.jpg 950w, https://alshaabalwaseem.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/HDPE-scrap-supplier-Sharjah-Sajja-Industrial-Area-location-map-1-300x226.jpg 300w, https://alshaabalwaseem.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/HDPE-scrap-supplier-Sharjah-Sajja-Industrial-Area-location-map-1-768x580.jpg 768w\" alt=\"HDPE 100 scrap buyers uae\" width=\"950\" height=\"717\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" data-object-position=\"55% 25%\" /></p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-cover-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Industrial Plastic Recycling &amp; Scrap Buyers in UAE</h1>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Comprehensive Plastic Recycling Services Across the UAE. We sell and export to Pakistan, India, GCC. Pickup 24 hour<a href=\"http://971529244592\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"7\">#contact</a>s.</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-a89b3969 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/971529244592\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sell Your Scrap →</a></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/971529244592\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Buy Scrap / Export →</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><em>25+ Years Scrap buyers UAE</em></h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Serving factories in Sharjah , Ajman ,Abudhabi and every where in UAE</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">5,000+ Tons Exported in 2025</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">To Pakistan, India ,and europe</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">1,000+ Tons Imported in 2025</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">From USA,EUROPE,MALAYSIA,TURKEY AND MANY ASIAN COUNTRIES</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Types of Plastic Scrap We Recycle &amp; Purchase in Dubai, Sharjah, Abudhabi</h2>\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-ast-global-color-1-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-dd7e428d86a3774cc25fc224a0dc4d27\"><em>METALS SCRAP</em></h3>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Aluminium acsr scrap</li>\n<li>Aluminium Dross scrap</li>\n<li>Aluminium wire scrap</li>\n<li>Aluminium cable scrap</li>\n<li>Aluminium sandwich sheet composite sheet</li>\n<li>Aluminium attachment materials</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-ast-global-color-1-color has-ast-global-color-7-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-3ef636612b556ac3a107e5e767c3f5a1\"><strong><em>PLASTIC SCRAP</em></strong></h3>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Hdpe 100 scrap</li>\n<li>Pvc pipe scrap</li>\n<li>Hdpe 100 granule</li>\n<li>Pc Bottle scrap</li>\n<li>Window profile upvc scrap</li>\n<li>Ppr pipe scrap</li>\n<li>Pmma signboard scrap</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-ast-global-color-7-background-color has-background\">Sell Your Scrap in 3 Easy Steps</h2>\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">1.Send Photos</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">WhatsApp photos of your scrap and location in Ajman, Dubai or Sharjah Abudhabi uae</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>2.We Price It</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">We visit, weigh on digital scale, and give best market price same day</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3.Get Paid</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Instant cash or bank transfer, and we pickup with our truck 24 hours pickup<a href=\"#contact\" data-type=\"internal\" data-id=\"#contact\">#contact</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-a89b3969 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-width wp-block-button__width-50 is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/971529244592\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WhatsApp Now +971 52 924 4592</a></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Or email us: <a href=\"mailto:nadeemalsaham@gmail.com\">nadeemalsaham@gmail.com</a></p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-ast-global-color-7-background-color has-background\">PLASTIC SCRAP AND METALS SCRAP WE USUALLY DEAL IN</h3>\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-27\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1.3369542510967203; width: 459px; height: auto;\" src=\"https://alshaabalwaseem.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/acsr-conductor-scrap-scrap-buyers-uae-1.jpg\" alt=\"ALUMINIUM ACSR SCRAP BUYERS UAE\" width=\"250\" height=\"187\" /></figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-28\" src=\"https://alshaabalwaseem.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/aluminium-dross-scrap-buyers-uae.jpg\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" srcset=\"https://alshaabalwaseem.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/aluminium-dross-scrap-buyers-uae.jpg 500w, https://alshaabalwaseem.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/aluminium-dross-scrap-buyers-uae-300x262.jpg 300w\" alt=\"ALUMINIUM DROSS SCRAP BUYER UAE\" width=\"500\" height=\"437\" /></figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignfull size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-29\" src=\"https://alshaabalwaseem.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/HDPE-100-scrap-bales-Sharjah-UAE-for-export.webp\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" srcset=\"https://alshaabalwaseem.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/HDPE-100-scrap-bales-Sharjah-UAE-for-export.webp 1000w, https://alshaabalwaseem.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/HDPE-100-scrap-bales-Sharjah-UAE-for-export-300x225.webp 300w, https://alshaabalwaseem.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/HDPE-100-scrap-bales-Sharjah-UAE-for-export-768x576.webp 768w\" alt=\"HDPE100 PIPE AND GRANULES SCRAP BUYERS UAE\" width=\"1000\" height=\"750\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><style>\n/* GLOBAL THEME OVERHAUL */<br />\n/* HIDE DEFAULT THEME TITLE */<br />\nheader.entry-header, h1.entry-title, .ast-archive-description { display: none !important; margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; height: 0 !important; }</p>\n<p>body, html, .elementor-page {<br />\n    background-color: #f2f6f4 !important;<br />\n    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif !important;<br />\n}</p>\n<p>h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6, .elementor-heading-title {<br />\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif !important;<br />\n    font-weight: 700 !important;<br />\n}</p>\n<p>/* FORCE TRANSPARENT MENU BACKGROUNDS (STRIP GREY BOXES & GRADIENTS) */<br />\n.main-navigation,<br />\n.ast-main-header-bar,<br />\n.ast-primary-header-bar,<br />\n.ast-desktop-header-content,<br />\n.main-header-menu,<br />\n.ast-nav-menu,<br />\n.ast-builder-menu,<br />\n.ast-builder-menu-1,<br />\n#ast-desktop-header,<br />\n#ast-mobile-header,<br />\n.site-header {<br />\n    background: transparent !important;<br />\n    background-color: transparent !important;<br />\n    background-image: none !important;<br />\n    border: none !important;<br />\n    box-shadow: none !important;<br />\n}</p>\n<p>.main-header-menu li,<br />\n.main-header-menu li a,<br />\n.ast-nav-menu li,<br />\n.ast-nav-menu li a,<br />\n.current-menu-item,<br />\n.current-menu-item > a,<br />\n.current_page_item,<br />\n.current_page_item > a {<br />\n    background: transparent !important;<br />\n    background-color: transparent !important;<br />\n    background-image: none !important;<br />\n    border: none !important;<br />\n    box-shadow: none !important;<br />\n}</p>\n<p>/* KEEP DROPDOWN WHITE BOX */<br />\n.main-header-menu .sub-menu, .ast-nav-menu .sub-menu {<br />\n    background-color: #ffffff !important;<br />\n    box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(13, 149, 77, 0.1) !important;<br />\n}<br />\n.main-header-menu .sub-menu li a:hover, .ast-nav-menu .sub-menu li a:hover {<br />\n    background-color: rgba(13, 149, 77, 0.05) !important;<br />\n}</p>\n<p>/* FIX OLD ASTRA MENU (REMOVE GREY BACKGROUND) */<br />\n.main-header-menu, .ast-primary-menu-child {<br />\n    background: transparent !important;<br />\n}<br />\n.main-header-menu > li > a {<br />\n    background: transparent !important;<br />\n    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif !important;<br />\n    font-weight: bold !important;<br />\n    color: #333 !important;<br />\n    transition: color 0.3s ease !important;<br />\n}<br />\n.main-header-menu > li > a:hover {<br />\n    color: #0d954d !important;<br />\n}</p>\n<p>/* ASTRA DROPDOWN OVERRIDE (DONGSHENG STYLE) */<br />\n.main-header-menu .sub-menu, .ast-nav-menu .sub-menu {<br />\n    background: #ffffff !important;<br />\n    border-radius: 12px !important;<br />\n    box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(13, 149, 77, 0.1) !important;<br />\n    border: none !important;<br />\n    padding: 10px 0 !important;<br />\n}</p>\n<p>.main-header-menu .sub-menu li a, .ast-nav-menu .sub-menu li a {<br />\n    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif !important;<br />\n    font-size: 15px !important;<br />\n    color: #666 !important;<br />\n    background: transparent !important;<br />\n    transition: all 0.3s ease !important;<br />\n}</p>\n<p>.main-header-menu .sub-menu li a:hover, .ast-nav-menu .sub-menu li a:hover {<br />\n    color: #0d954d !important;<br />\n    background: rgba(13, 149, 77, 0.05) !important;<br />\n    padding-left: 25px !important;<br />\n}</p>\n<p>/* STICKY SIDEBAR */<br />\n.custom-sticky-sidebar {<br />\n    position: fixed;<br />\n    right: 0;<br />\n    top: 50%;<br />\n    transform: translateY(-50%);<br />\n    z-index: 99999;<br />\n    display: flex;<br />\n    flex-direction: column;<br />\n    gap: 2px;<br />\n}<br />\n.custom-sticky-sidebar a {<br />\n    background-color: transparent !important;<br />\n    color: #0d954d !important;<br />\n    padding: 10px !important;<br />\n    font-size: 40px !important;<br />\n    text-align: center;<br />\n    transition: all 0.3s;<br />\n    text-decoration: none;<br />\n    box-shadow: none !important;<br />\n}<br />\n.custom-sticky-sidebar a:hover {<br />\n    background-color: transparent !important;<br />\n    color: #0a733b !important;<br />\n    transform: scale(1.2);<br />\n    padding-right: 10px !important;<br />\n}</p>\n<p>/* HEADER OVERRIDES */<br />\n.site-header, .ast-main-header-wrap, #masthead, .ast-primary-header-bar {<br />\n    position: absolute !important;<br />\n    top: 10px !important;<br />\n    right: 12px !important;<br />\n    width: 100% !important;<br />\n    background: transparent !important;<br />\n    border: none !important;<br />\n    z-index: 9999 !important;<br />\n    display: flex !important;<br />\n    justify-content: flex-end !important;<br />\n}<br />\n.site-branding, .site-title, .site-logo, .ast-site-identity {<br />\n    display: none !important;<br />\n}<br />\n.main-header-menu, .ast-nav-menu {<br />\n    background: transparent !important;<br />\n    display: flex !important;<br />\n    justify-content: flex-end !important;<br />\n}<br />\n.main-header-menu > li > a, .ast-nav-menu > li > a {<br />\n    background: transparent !important;<br />\n    background-image: none !important;<br />\n    box-shadow: none !important;<br />\n    background-color: transparent !important;<br />\n}<br />\n.main-header-menu > li.current-menu-item > a,<br />\n.main-header-menu > li.current_page_item > a,<br />\n.ast-nav-menu > li.current-menu-item > a,<br />\n.ast-nav-menu > li.current_page_item > a,<br />\n.main-header-menu > li:hover > a,<br />\n.ast-nav-menu > li:hover > a {<br />\n    background: transparent !important;<br />\n    background-image: none !important;<br />\n    background-color: transparent !important;<br />\n}<br />\n.main-header-menu li, .ast-nav-menu li {<br />\n    background-color: transparent !important;<br />\n}<br />\n/* END HEADER OVERRIDES */</p>\n</style>\n<div class=\"custom-sticky-sidebar\"><a title=\"Email Us\" href=\"mailto:nadeemalsaham@gmail.com\">✉️</a><br /><a title=\"Call Us\" href=\"tel:971554779240\">📞</a><br /><a title=\"WhatsApp\" href=\"https://wa.me/971529244592\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">💬</a></div>\n",
